## RelationType: Supplied By

Connects each material to its supplier using a direct foreign-key mapping.

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
| --- | --- | --- |
| material | supplier | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
| --- | --- |
| supplier_id | supplier_id |
